{%- doc -%}
  Static section wrapper around snippets/cart-drawer.liquid, so the drawer's content
  is addressable as a real section via the Section Rendering API (cart AJAX endpoints'
  `sections` param, and `?section_id=cart-drawer-section`). Without this, requesting
  "cart-drawer-section" resolves to nothing, and the drawer never refreshes after an
  item is added — it just shows whatever it looked like on the initial page load.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- render 'cart-drawer', render_wrapper: false -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart drawer"
}
{% endschema %}
